<view class="page"><view class="title">我的健身记录</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{mode === 'mock'}}">{{notice}}</view><view class="notice" wx:else>本地开发账号会话，不是微信身份认证</view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{busy}}">正在读取账号…</view><view wx:else>当前账号：{{account}}</view><view class="muted">个人记录入口。未提供员工或付费业务入口。</view><view class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="reload" disabled="{{busy}}">重试</button></view><view class="card"><view>{{recordNotice}}</view><view class="muted">体重、饮食、训练手动记录，无需会员。</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || !!error}}" bindtap="records">新增 / 查看记录</button></view><button bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录并清除本机记录</button></view>